OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are the new rules in
OL,4,AScotland's supermarkets?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSugary soft drinks, biscuits and some
OL,7,Fbreakfast cereals have disappeared from
OL,8,Fprominent positions in Scotland's
OL,9,Fsupermarkets.
OL,11,FThe Scottish government has introduced
OL,12,Frules meaning some products that are
OL,13,Fhigh in fat, sugar and salt can no
OL,14,Flonger be put in prime end-of-aisle
OL,15,Fslots, or feature as part of multi-buy
OL,16,Foffers in store or online.
OL,18,FThe regulations will apply to the usual
OL,19,Fsuspects - chocolate, crisps, biscuits
OL,20,Fand ice cream.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
