OL,3,GNEWSAWhat are the new rules in
OL,4,AScotland's supermarkets?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut it could also include kombucha,
OL,7,Fseaweed snacks, muesli and chewing gum,
OL,8,Fdepending on their sugar content.
